Core Concepts Covered:

Ranking algorithms (RANK(), DENSE_RANK(), ROW_NUMBER())

Partitioning data slices (OVER(PARTITION BY ... ORDER BY ...))

Pareto analysis and percentage-of-total distribution (e.g., Top 1% vs Top 20% revenue generators)

Conditional logic and customer segment labeling (CASE WHEN ... THEN, IF)

